---
description: Use repo-context MCP tools before broad file reads
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Before reading broad file contents, use the repo-context MCP tools first.

For repo discovery:
1. Use repo_map to understand structure.
2. Use search_code for keywords.
3. Use get_file_outline before reading a full file.
4. Use get_symbol_context for function/class-level context.
5. Only read full files when making or verifying an edit.

Prefer small symbol-level context over full file dumps.
